{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["陶器的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对耶利米说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“你去陶匠家，在那里我有话告诉你。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我便下到陶匠家，见他正用轮盘做器皿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他手中陶造的器皿做坏了，他就用那块泥做成别的器皿，想怎么做就怎么做。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["这时，耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["“以色列人啊，难道我不能像陶匠对待陶泥一样对待你们吗？以色列人啊，你们在我手中就像陶泥在陶匠手中一样。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["当我宣布要铲除、推翻、毁灭哪一邦或哪一国的时候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["如果他们悔过自新，我必施怜悯，取消我原本要降给他们的灾祸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["当我宣布要建造和栽培哪一邦或哪一国的时候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["如果他们做我视为恶的事，不听从我的话，我必改变心意，取消我原本要赐给他们的福气。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因此，你去告诉犹大人和耶路撒冷的居民，‘耶和华说，我正计划降灾祸惩罚你们。你们要离开罪恶，改邪归正。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们却说，‘没用！我们要随心所欲，为所欲为。’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"因此耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们问问列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看谁曾听过这样的事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女以色列竟做了一件极可怕的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩山岭上的积雪会融化吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从远方流来的冰凉溪水会停止吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，我的子民却把我忘记，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向虚无的神明烧香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他们跌倒，偏离古道，走入僻陋的小路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他们的土地必荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永远遭人嗤笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"经过此地的人无不惊惧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摇头叹息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在敌人面前驱散他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像东风吹散尘土一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他们遭难的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必以背相向，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不理睬他们。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["他们说：“来！我们设计对付耶利米吧，反正我们一直有祭司教导律法，有智者出谋划策，有先知传讲预言。来吧！我们抨击他，不要理会他的话。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，求你眷顾我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听听敌人对我的指控。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人岂能以恶报善？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们竟设陷阱谋害我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你顾念我怎样站在你面前为他们求情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怎样求你不要向他们发烈怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，求你让他们丧身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儿女饿死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"妻子丧夫亡子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"男人被杀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"青年死于战场！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当你使敌军突袭他们时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他们家中传出哭喊声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们挖陷阱要捕捉我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"设圈套要绊我的脚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你知道他们害我的各种诡计，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要赦免他们的罪过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要从你眼前涂抹他们的罪恶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你使他们倒在你面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你在烈怒中惩罚他们。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}